    "text": "Let the domain of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then the value of the integral&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
