  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Apply&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
